Act as a senior luxury-brand creative director, award-winning editorial web designer, UX strategist, e-commerce architect, and experienced full-stack developer.

Design and build a complete, production-minded website for my independent creative business, **Karunya by Mahek**.

Do not simply create a generic e-commerce template, a basic portfolio, or a pretty static landing page. I want an original, visually exceptional luxury digital experience with functional shopping, a custom-order enquiry system, and a private product-management dashboard.

I am a beginner with no coding experience. You must generate the application, explain necessary setup steps in simple language, and prioritise free tools and free hosting options.

Do not stop after presenting a design proposal or code snippets. Build the actual working application and help me test it.

